      "instance_name": "barack_obama",
      "label": "Barack Obama",
      "description": "Former U.S. President, widely recognized public figure whose speeches and public appearances are often referenced in internet memes. His image is used here to represent a moment of hesitation or awkwardness, which is the core of the meme’s humor.",
